        "quote": "The driver recalls a short gap in a radio conversation while seated after unloading, but a colleague says he remained responsive and might simply have been distracted by paperwork; the nurse cannot confirm loss of consciousness or a blackout from the conflicting accounts, a pulse reading taken later does not resolve awareness during the episode, and the physician has requested further history rather than diagnosing a specific cause.",
